		(at 12.75 39.5)
		(descr "Snaptron 7mm 4-leg dome, PRODUCTION contact footprint. pad1=centre 2.86mm (Snaptron P1); pad2=leg ring 4.4-6.9mm dia (T1/W1/N1) as 13 overlapping circles spanning 292deg with a 67.5deg escape gap at +y for the column trace to reach the centre pad (worst-case dome rotation keeps 3 of 4 legs on the ring). Venting comes from the Snaptron retention-tape channels (no PCB vent hole). F.Cu keepout r3.8: tracks allowed (mask-covered), no vias/pour; PLUS an all-layer via keepout r3.6 (a tented via bump under the dome seat breaks contact, and Freerouting only honours via keepouts that cover every layer). ENIG required. Ring circle angles MUST match gen_board.py RING_ANGLES.")
